 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idp27935008\" class=\"interactive ost-tag-lo-apbio-ch38-s03-lo02 ost-tag-lo-apbio-ch38-s03-aplo-1-21 ost-assessed-feature\" data-label=\"Link to Learning\">\n<h2 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n\n<p id=\"fs-idp3322800\">Explore an <a href=\"https://openstax.org/l/exotic_invasive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">interactive global database</a> of exotic or invasive species.</p>\n<div data-type=\"injected-exercise\" class=\"os-embed autogenerated-content\" data-injected-from-nickname=\"\" data-injected-from-version=\"15\" data-injected-from-url=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/api/exercises?q=tag:apbio-ch38-ex033\" data-tags=\"apbio-ch38-ex033 exid:apbio-ch38-ex033 context-cnxfeature:fs-idp27935008 context-cnxmod:f2790fc0-cc62-4906-b379-245f4b65abc8 review aplo:stax-apbio:SYI-2.A aplo:stax-apbio:SYI-1.G aplo:stax-apbio:SYI-1.H aplo:stax-apbio:EVO-1.O context-cnxmod:ef12a7d2-c569-4f8b-833c-595454102c1a apbio-ch38 apbio-ch38-s03 apbio-ch38-s03-lo02 context-cnxmod:1f383a77-28e1-4731-b53b-838f52ddc587 context-cnxmod:8bc8eaa2-e79c-4347-9521-a797be518a7f dok:2 science-practice:concept-explanation time:short blooms:2 book:stax-bio apbio book:stax-apbio ost-chapter-review filter-type:import:hs inbook-yes book-slug:biology-ap-courses module-slug:biology-ap-courses:38-3-threats-to-biodiversity module-slug:biology:47-3-threats-to-biodiversity module-slug:biology-2e:47-3-threats-to-biodiversity assignment-type:reading book-slug:biology book-slug:biology-2e\" data-is-vocab=\"false\" data-question-count=\"1\" data-is-multipart=\"False\">\n    \n    <div data-type=\"exercise-question\" data-is-answer-order-important=\"true\" data-formats=\"free-response multiple-choice\" id=\"242894\"><div class=\"os-problem-container\">\n        <div data-type=\"question-stem\">How do iguanas propagate both themselves and other invasive species?</div>\n        <ol data-type=\"question-answers\" type=\"a\">\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">Iguanas interbreed with invasive species and their offspring continue to breed.</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">Iguanas consume other exotic animal and seed species.</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">Iguanas reproduce in urban settings and defecate the seeds of invasive plants.</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">Iguanas reproduce in settings where other invasive species thrive.</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            </ol>\n        </div></div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
 "stimulus_html": "",
